    "detailed_description": "\u200e\u200e <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874290/extras/0b1325ffefa7789e3c7cb7b9ccbb9d41.avif?t=1717001814\" width=600 height=156 /></span><br><br>&quot;Wind Rider&quot; is an engaging gliding game that combines simplicity with endless fun. Players navigate through a dynamic, endless map filled with randomly generated obstacles, offering a fresh experience with every play. Perfect for quick entertainment or leisurely play, the goal is to outmaneuver challenges and achieve new high scores. With its easy-to-learn mechanics, &quot;Wind Rider&quot; is an ideal game for anyone looking to enjoy a relaxing yet thrilling gaming session.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874290/extras/627e6f697705044b8cac5b2d057284b5.poster.avif?t=1717001814\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874290/extras/627e6f697705044b8cac5b2d057284b5.webm?t=1717001814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874290/extras/627e6f697705044b8cac5b2d057284b5.mp4?t=1717001814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Zohal is a passionate but small team of three people, and Wind Rider is our first official game, with two larger games in the making. Wind Rider is not a game with a ton of content. But we hope that it will help you fill your free time with fun and relaxing gaming sessions at an affordable price.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874290/extras/ae4c227290b888042c008e6eb37a1dd4.poster.avif?t=1717001814\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874290/extras/ae4c227290b888042c008e6eb37a1dd4.webm?t=1717001814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874290/extras/ae4c227290b888042c008e6eb37a1dd4.mp4?t=1717001814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Don't hesitate to reach out with any feedback, inquiries, or issues regarding the game. We're here to assist and will respond promptly. Additionally, we'd love to hear if you had a great experience with the game \u2013 it truly brightens our day!!",
    "about_the_game": "\u200e\u200e <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874290/extras/0b1325ffefa7789e3c7cb7b9ccbb9d41.avif?t=1717001814\" width=600 height=156 /></span><br><br>&quot;Wind Rider&quot; is an engaging gliding game that combines simplicity with endless fun. Players navigate through a dynamic, endless map filled with randomly generated obstacles, offering a fresh experience with every play. Perfect for quick entertainment or leisurely play, the goal is to outmaneuver challenges and achieve new high scores. With its easy-to-learn mechanics, &quot;Wind Rider&quot; is an ideal game for anyone looking to enjoy a relaxing yet thrilling gaming session.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874290/extras/627e6f697705044b8cac5b2d057284b5.poster.avif?t=1717001814\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874290/extras/627e6f697705044b8cac5b2d057284b5.webm?t=1717001814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874290/extras/627e6f697705044b8cac5b2d057284b5.mp4?t=1717001814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Zohal is a passionate but small team of three people, and Wind Rider is our first official game, with two larger games in the making. Wind Rider is not a game with a ton of content. But we hope that it will help you fill your free time with fun and relaxing gaming sessions at an affordable price.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874290/extras/ae4c227290b888042c008e6eb37a1dd4.poster.avif?t=1717001814\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874290/extras/ae4c227290b888042c008e6eb37a1dd4.webm?t=1717001814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874290/extras/ae4c227290b888042c008e6eb37a1dd4.mp4?t=1717001814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Don't hesitate to reach out with any feedback, inquiries, or issues regarding the game. We're here to assist and will respond promptly. Additionally, we'd love to hear if you had a great experience with the game \u2013 it truly brightens our day!!",
